  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; font-size: medium; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"></span>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"></div>\n<div>　</div>\n<div style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">鳥取砂丘からおひさまに向かって〜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ひら砲〜！！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">〜♫</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ﾃﾚﾚﾚ</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ﾃｯﾃｯﾃｰ</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\"><span class=\"s3\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ひらほはレベルがあがった！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\"><span class=\"s3\">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ファファファファ</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ミ♭</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ソ</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ファー</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">と弾いてみると、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">レベルを</span><span class=\"s1\">1</span><span class=\"s2\">つあげることができますよ</span><span class=\"s4\">🤫</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">鳥</span><span class=\"s5\">取県出身</span><span class=\"s6\">&nbsp;19</span><span class=\"s5\">歳</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">平尾帆夏</span><span class=\"s1\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">ひらおほのか</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span><span class=\"s2\">です！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/hirao.honoka/2022-11-13/51670_0.jpg\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">今日は「</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;Happy Smile Tour 2022&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">」</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">東京公演</span><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">日目です</span><span class=\"s4\">🌈</span><span class=\"s2\">！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">四期生もステージに立たせて頂きます。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">昨日来てくださった方ありがとうございました！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">緊張でいっぱいでしたが、サイリウムの光に勇気づけられました</span><span class=\"s4\">☀️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">今日公演に来て下さる方、会場で待ってます</span><span class=\"s4\">☺️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">生配信もありますので、是非四期生初のステージを見ていただけると嬉しいです！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ライブの写真は次のブログでのせます</span><span class=\"s4\">✊🏻</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">&nbsp;̖́</span><span class=\"s1\">-</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">‬</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral-Regular;\">⬛︎</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ひなあい</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral-Regular;\">⬛︎</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">みなさま！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">2</span><span class=\"s2\">週に渡って四期生を紹介して頂きました、</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ひなあいは見て頂けましたでしょうか。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">ふむふむ</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ありがとうございます！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">もずく酢飲むの早かったでしょ〜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ある日、もずく酢を飲んでいるところを母に驚かれ、練習を重ね、やがて特技となりました。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">ミーグリで</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">もずく飲む派だよ！と言ってくださるお仲間もいて嬉しかったです</span><span class=\"s1\">-</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">&nbsp;̗̀</span><span class=\"s4\">🤝</span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">&nbsp;̖́</span><span class=\"s1\">-</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">なんとオーディションでは</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">二次審査から最終審査までずっと飲んでました</span><span class=\"s4\">㊙️</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">そしてそして</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">髙橋未来虹さんが私と山下を紹介してくださいました</span><span class=\"s1\">‪</span><span class=\"s4\">🌷</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">未来虹さんは本番前からとてもとてもお優しく、声をかけてくださったり、写真を撮ってブログにも載せて下さって</span><span class=\"s1\">…</span><span class=\"s2\">本当に嬉しいです</span><span class=\"s4\">😢</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">最後にこっそり運動音痴なのばれてました</span><span class=\"s4\">😵‍💫</span><span class=\"s1\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral-Regular;\">⬛︎</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">ドキュメンタリー</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s2\">オフショット</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: STIXGeneral-Regular;\">⬛︎</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><img alt=\"image0.jpeg\" id=\"91A20F0C-7857-421D-A256-D8E46A881468\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/hirao.honoka/2022-11-13/51670_1.jpg\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 24.5px;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img alt=\"IMG_4504.jpeg\" id=\"AD0E3852-073B-49CE-A65C-451F8CC2F09A\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 0px); margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"/images/blogs/hirao.honoka/2022-11-13/51670_2.jpg\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p4\" style=\"margi